{
    "title": "JYouPro - Fitness Tracker",
    "description": "Keeping up with your health has never been as easy as it is with JYouPro App.\r\nNote: JYouPro application is compatible with the following JYouPro Smartwatches:\r\n\r\n- ZW01 Smartwatch\r\n- T18 Smartwatch\r\n- ZW27T Smartwatch\r\n- T100 Smartwatch\r\n- T100A Smartwatch\r\n- L21 Smartwatch\r\n- S050 Smartwatch\r\n- T95 Smartwatch\r\n- G12Pro Smartwatch\r\n\r\nThis application will help you:\r\n\r\n1. Push call notification to smart watch, and let your know who is calling.\r\n2. Push SMS notification to smart watch and you can read text and detail of SMS on your wearable device.\r\n3. Display your heart rate, sleeping and workout history tracked from your smart watch.\r\n4. Sedentary reminders to help you reach your fitness goals.\r\n5. Weather check so you can plan your days and workouts accordingly.\r\n6. Alarm\r\n7. Drink water reminders\r\n8. Multiple watch face options",
    "descriptionHTML": "Keeping up with your health has never been as easy as it is with JYouPro App.<br>Note: JYouPro application is compatible with the following JYouPro Smartwatches:<br><br>- ZW01 Smartwatch<br>- T18 Smartwatch<br>- ZW27T Smartwatch<br>- T100 Smartwatch<br>- T100A Smartwatch<br>- L21 Smartwatch<br>- S050 Smartwatch<br>- T95 Smartwatch<br>- G12Pro Smartwatch<br><br>This application will help you:<br><br>1. Push call notification to smart watch, and let your know who is calling.<br>2. Push SMS notification to smart watch and you can read text and detail of SMS on your wearable device.<br>3. Display your heart rate, sleeping and workout history tracked from your smart watch.<br>4. Sedentary reminders to help you reach your fitness goals.<br>5. Weather check so you can plan your days and workouts accordingly.<br>6. Alarm<br>7. Drink water reminders<br>8. Multiple watch face options",
    "summary": "Keeping up with your health has never been as easy as it is with JYouPro App.",
